test: three rounds, {m-e+f}, {m-f+2}, sorry {m-f}, and {m+e}. mean?
exam: It is given that {a} attained scores of {m+e}, {m-f} and {m-e+f} points in three games. Determine the arithmetic mean of the said scores.
exam: Ascertain the mean mark obtained by {a} in three examinations, the marks being {m-f}, {m+e} and {m-e+f}.
exam: Whereas four pupils read {m-f}, {m+g}, {m+e} and {m-e+f-g} pages respectively, state the average number of pages read per pupil.
exam: Compute the average of the four quantities {m+e}, {m-f}, {m+g} and {m-e+f-g}.
exercise: {a}'s grandad passed away in the spring, and {a} missed some lessons. Still, {a.he} scored {m+e}, {m-f} and {m-e+f} in three tests. What is {a.his} average score?
exercise: The report says {a} "could do better". {a.His} three marks were {m-f}, {m+e} and {m-e+f}. What is the average mark?
test: teacher reckons im "a late bloomer", load of rubbish. got {m+e}, {m-e+f} and {m-f}. whats my average then
